> normalized ToolInvocation -> ToolResult contract.
> 
> Usage:
>     broker = OpenAIProgrammaticBroker(
>         client=openai_client,
>         model="gpt-6-astra",
>         callable_tools={"get_inventory": inventory_spec},
>         artifact_factory=make_artifact,
